library_id: instrument_library.

library_name: Instrument Library.

library_schema: the instrument schema.

library_version: 1.0.0.

entry_type: instrument.

library_description: A curated, provenance-aware library of scientific instruments, their specifications, their calibration histories, their operational envelopes, and their measurement uncertainties.

The registration is done once per deployment.

